# BEAST System 3.0 - Backend & Cloud Deployment Engine

Enterprise backend service and GitHub-to-Cloud deployment bridge for **BEAST System 3.0**, operating under GitHub organization/username **`pat333-ux`** and deployed live on Google Cloud Run.

---

## 🌐 Live Service Endpoint
* **Cloud Run URL:** [https://beastsystem-70875693050.us-central1.run.app](https://beastsystem-70875693050.us-central1.run.app)
* **Health Check:** `GET /healthz`
* **Webhook Receiver:** `POST /api/v1/webhooks/github`

---

## 🚀 Repository Structure

```text
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/
│       └── deploy-cloud-run.yml   # Automated GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline
├── beast_github_cloud_sync.py     # Flask backend, HMAC security, system bus
├── Dockerfile                     # Production container configuration
├── requirements.txt               # Python runtime dependencies
├── deploy_cloud_run.sh            # Manual shell deployment script
├── .env.example                   # Environment variable template
└── README.md                      # Documentation
